div.ab:
Between v. 26 and v. 27 A and B give v. 42 as given below;Between v. 27 and v. 28 A and B give v. 41, 18 ( both repeated ) and v. 43 as given below;Both A and B give vv. 44, 45 46 and 38 respectively as given below, between v. 32 and v. 33;
makārabhakārau sakāramakārau jaladharamālā vr̥ttajātiḥ khyātā kīrtitā । abdhyaṅgai
ścaturbhiraṣṭabhiśca virāmairityarthaḥ ॥ 38 ॥
